  message: "SPLIT IN from WI-molon-rorop-nuhuv-finuz-dabuk-ravaf-fidij-pokas part 1 (owner-approved 2026-11-01, P4 review). Live at dev 9ae4abe13f with tree-sitter-agda 1.3.3 (fixtures ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/langs1/fx_molon): after a data block with ONE constructor, the next signature 'foo : Unit -> Unit' is split into two function nodes ('foo' and ': Unit -> Unit') and foo is not emitted; a following 'data Bool' header is lost too (Bool not emitted, true/false come out as functions). It breaks the next declaration, not every later one. Same layout-block mechanism as this item."  # 1c77
